# project

## Overview
This repository contains the work for a data analytics project completed as part of coursework exploring Git workflows

## Contents
- `data/` — raw and/or processed datasets used in the analysis
- `docs/` — supporting documentation
- `report/` — final report and written analysis
- `src/` — source code / scripts
- `images/` — figures and visual assets
- `Report.ipynb` — main analysis notebook, including data preprocessing and a logistic regression model built with scikit-learn
- `environment.yaml` — conda environment specification for reproducing this project's setup
